              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, shield, and thrusting spears. May have light armour +2 pts. Large shields may be substituted for +1 pt. May have bows +2 pts. Combined Formation. Mixed armour. Satrapal Guards (the Persians) are only allowed if the Great King is NOT present. 0-1 unit. (Alexander the Great p.93)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="83f1-3d18-faf9-9c31" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
