              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, shield, and thrusting spears. May have light armour +2 pts. Large shields may be substituted for +1 pt. May replace spears with javelins, or slings (free), or bows +1 pt. Combined Formation. Mixed armour. Kardakes armed with slings, javelins, or bows are Light Infantry. (Alexander the Great p.93)</characteristic>
