              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Mardians are equipped with daggers and bows, and may have light armour +2 pts. Levies. Light Infantry. Every second Takabara/Mardian unit may be Mardian Archers (not enforced). Mardians may fire two ranks at full effect if stationary, other ranks use Massed archery as normal. (Alexander the Great p.94)</characteristic>
