            <profile id="6f5e-8b1f-3c83-8c9c" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="0641-2ee1-c462-c414" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with dagger, javelins and shields. Thrusting spears may replace javelins +1 pt. Every second unit may replace javelins/shields with short bows for free, or with bows +1 pt (not enforced). Levies. Warband Psychology Rule 1. Combined Formations. Mixed armour. Satrapal levies may only count Leadership from characters that are attached to them, as well as the Great King's bonus. (Alexander the Great p.94)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="f33b-b0d9-85a8-b8a1" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
