              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with sickle (halberd) and javelins. May have light armour +2 pts. May have bucklers +1 pt or large shields +2 pts. Lykians are Light Infantry. Lykians and Carians are subject to Warband Psychology rule 1. (Alexander the Great p.94)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
