                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each machine has a crew of two men armed with swords. The crew may have light armour +2 pts each. Light Ballistas may be grouped in batteries of three models. One light ballista may be taken for each Persian infantry unit in the army. Light Ballista: Range 36", Strength 4/-1 per rank, no save, D3 wounds per hit. (Alexander the Great p.94)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="32"/>
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
